### Template / Demo Requests
### Base URLs
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@adminUrl = {{baseUrl}}/api/admin
@tenantUrl = {{baseUrl}}/api/tenant
@publicUrl = {{baseUrl}}/api/public
@token = your_tenant_token_here
@adminToken = your_admin_token_here

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Public Routes
### ------------------------------------------------------------------

### Health Check / Status
GET {{publicUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Tenant Routes
### ------------------------------------------------------------------

### Get Current Tenant Profile
GET {{tenantUrl}}/profile
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Resource (Write Request - subjected to subscription access check)
POST {{tenantUrl}}/resources
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "title": "Tenant Item",
    "description": "Demonstration write request"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Admin Routes
### ------------------------------------------------------------------

### List All Tenants
GET {{adminUrl}}/tenants
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
